BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4267744@vidiotsfoundation.org
DTSTAMP:20260711T233000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T175500
SUMMARY:Coroner to the Stars
LOCATION:MUBI Microcinema at Vidiots\, 4884 Eagle Rock Blvd\, Los Angeles\,
  CA 90041
URL:https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4267744/
DESCRIPTION:Run time: 85 min | Format: Digital\n\nSeries: Additional Shows\
 , Groundbreaking Non-Fiction\, In the MUBI Microcinema\, Special Guests in
  Attendance\n\nJoin us in the microcinema for a fascinating documentary at
  the intersection of Hollywood\, morbid curiosity\, and the American immig
 rant experience\, Coroner to the Stars - a chronicle of the extraordinary 
 journey of Dr. Thomas Noguchi\, the former Los Angeles County Chief Medica
 l Examiner-Coroner whose groundbreaking autopsies forever shaped American 
 culture.\nWith director Ben Hethcoat in conversation with Adrienne Hill on
  Sunday\, July 12th!\n\nTickets: https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/42
 67744/\n\nDetails: https://vidiotsfoundation.org/movies/coroner-to-the-sta
 rs/
END:VEVENT
